{"sha": "c04a3ae5a24eacab160559e60193cd7ba8a6b9548bb268dcd1aeac4814be3325", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g8:equations} 章 --- 字母运算与方程}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:1}", "$5(2x + 3) = 10x + 15$.", "", "$-3(4x - 1) = -12x + 3$.", "", "$2(3x - 2) + 4(x + 5) = 6x - 4 + 4x + 20 = 10x + 16$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:2}", "$(x+2)(x+7) = x^2 + 7x + 2x + 14 = x^2 + 9x + 14$.", "", "$(3x+1)(2x-5) = 6x^2 - 15x + 2x - 5 = 6x^2 - 13x - 5$.", "", "$(x-4)(x-6) = x^2 - 6x - 4x + 24 = x^2 - 10x + 24$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:3}", "$4 \\times 3 - 5 = 7$：成立。 \\quad", "$2 \\times 3 + 1 = 7$ 与 $3 + 4 = 7$ 均成立。 \\quad", "$3^2 = 9$ 与 $6 \\times 3 - 9 = 9$ 均成立 --- $x = 3$ 能同时", "满足这三个式子。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:4}", "$x + 9 = 4$：$x = -5$（检验：$-5 + 9 = 4$）。", "", "$5x = -35$: $x = -7$.", "", "$\\frac x3 = 8$: $x = 24$.", "", "$2x - 7 = 13$：$2x = 20$，$x = 10$（检验：$20 - 7 = 13$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:5}", "$6x + 5 = 2x + 25$：$4x = 20$，故 $x = 5$。", "", "$9 - 4x = x - 11$：$20 = 5x$，故 $x = 4$。", "", "$3(x + 2) = 2x + 11$：$3x + 6 = 2x + 11$，故 $x = 5$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:6}", "$8x - 12 = 5x + 30$，故 $3x = 42$ 且 $x = 14$。检验：", "$4(28 - 3) = 100$ 与 $5(14 + 6) = 100$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:7}", "“$3x - 8 = 19$”：$3x = 27$，$x = 9$。", "", "“$2x + 5 = x + 12$”：$x = 7$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:8}", "宽为 $x$，长为 $x + 5$；周长 ", "$2\\bigl(x + (x + 5)\\bigr) = 4x + 10 = 58$，故 $4x = 48$ 且 $x = 12$：", "宽为 $12$ cm，长为 $17$ cm（检验：", "$2 \\times (12 + 17) = 58$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:9}", "这三个数分别为 $n - 1$、$n$、$n + 1$，其和为 $3n = 141$，故", "$n = 47$：这三个数是 $46$、$47$、$48$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:10}", "$3x + 4 > 19$：$3x > 15$，故 $x > 5$。", "", "$7 - 2x \\geq 1$：$-2x \\geq -6$，两边除以 $-2$，不等号方向改变：", "$x \\leq 3$.", "", "$5(x-1) < 2x + 7$：$5x - 5 < 2x + 7$，故 $3x < 12$ 且 $x < 4$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:11}", "经过 $n$ 个月后，米娅有 $140 + 15n$，汤姆有 $200 + 10n$。米娅领先", "的条件为", "\\[", "140 + 15n > 200 + 10n", "\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\", "5n > 60", "\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\", "n > 12 :", "\\]", "即从第 $13$ 个月起。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:equations:12}", "两边同乘 $20$：", "\\[", "5(x + 3) = 4(2x - 1)", "\\ \\Longrightarrow\\", "5x + 15 = 8x - 4", "\\ \\Longrightarrow\\", "19 = 3x", "\\ \\Longrightarrow\\", "x = \\frac{19}{3}.", "\\]", "检验：$\\frac{19/3 + 3}{4} = \\frac{28/3}{4} = \\frac{28}{12} =", "\\frac73$，而 $\\frac{2 \\times 19/3 - 1}{5} = \\frac{35/3}{5} =", "\\frac{35}{15} = \\frac73$。两者相等，方程的解为 $\\frac{19}{3}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g8:equations:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 两次运用分配律", "（由\\cref{thm:g8:equations:expand}），取 $c = a$，$d = b$：", "\\[", "(a + b)(a + b) = a^2 + ab + ba + b^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2 ,", "\\]", "因为 $ab$ 与 $ba$ 是同一个积。", ""]}